          <span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <br />
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Pursuant to Article III, Section B of Opinion No. 885, issued on December 16, 2022, in Docket No. RP19-1523-000, et al. The period of amortization is 35 years.</span>
          </span>
          <span style="font-size: 12pt;">
            <span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
                <br />
              </span>
            </span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
